<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-14152] JCache TCK suite runs some Ignite tests.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-14152</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There is a wrong configuration of the &quot;jcache-tck&quot; profile. It excludes only &quot;*Test.java&quot; classes, but by default maven runs also &quot;*Tests.java&quot; classes. &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;So, collection IgniteDataIntegrity*Tests* &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&#160;runs for every start of this TC suite.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also after IGNITE-130512 the default collection of test expanded, then there are more tests started to run within the suite and it started to fail by timeout.&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;1&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://maven.apache.org/surefire/maven-surefire-plugin/examples/inclusion-exclusion.html&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://maven.apache.org/surefire/maven-surefire-plugin/examples/inclusion-exclusion.html&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;2&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=5857723&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_JCacheTck11&amp;amp;tab=testsInfo&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/viewLog.html?buildId=5857723&amp;amp;buildTypeId=IgniteTests24Java8_JCacheTck11&amp;amp;tab=testsInfo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
